  "_comment": "Territories beyond the ISO sovereign states, each placed in one C10 sovereignty cell. `folder` = continent; `cell` = matrix cell id (see CELLS in build-country-data). Names/capital come from geonames: `iso` reads them from geonames-names.json, `geonameId` resolves the entity directly (the six non-ISO ones), `pop` is a hand estimate for tiering where geonames has none. The recognised trio (Kosovo/Taiwan/Palestine) are already sovereign states in the dump, so they carry only their cell.",

